WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:02.338
Hi, I'm Thimble!

00:00:02.338 --> 00:00:05.830
Most new image models remove noise with a Diffusion Transformer.

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:07.227
Here's how one works.

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:12.617
Cut a noisy latent into patches, treat them as tokens, and let

00:00:12.617 --> 00:00:14.439
the noise level steer every block.

00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:21.437
An encoder shrinks the image eight times per side, and training

00:00:21.437 --> 00:00:22.517
adds noise to it.

00:00:23.113 --> 00:00:27.231
Cut the latent into two by two patches: two hundred fifty-six tokens.

00:00:27.954 --> 00:00:31.531
Twenty-eight Transformer blocks let every token read every other.

00:00:31.951 --> 00:00:33.382
Out comes the predicted noise.

00:00:33.382 --> 00:00:35.099
Remove a little, and go again.

00:00:38.317 --> 00:00:39.996
So how does the noise level get in?

00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:43.033
The noise level and the label become a scale and a

00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:43.985
shift for each norm.

00:00:44.405 --> 00:00:48.403
Plus a gate that starts at zero, so every block begins as the identity.

00:00:48.823 --> 00:00:50.563
The MLP gets its own three.

00:00:50.563 --> 00:00:53.174
Together they are a third of every block's weights.

00:00:54.733 --> 00:00:59.760
Stable Diffusion three gives text and image separate weights, joined only inside attention.

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:04.365
Newer models project the text once, and one set of weights serves every token.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.427
Stable Diffusion three also changed the target.

00:01:09.847 --> 00:01:12.247
Mix the image and the noise along a straight line.

00:01:13.283 --> 00:01:17.061
Predict the velocity along it, then step from noise back to the image.

00:01:18.217 --> 00:01:21.455
Every sixteen by sixteen pixels become one token.

00:01:21.455 --> 00:01:25.097
Double the side, and attention's work grows sixteen times.

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:28.523
A Transformer over latent patches.

00:01:28.523 --> 00:01:32.203
The noise level steers its norms, and in text models the

00:01:32.203 --> 00:01:33.541
prompt joins its attention.

00:01:36.192 --> 00:01:39.398
Patches as tokens, norms steered by the noise, and a straight

00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:40.563
path to the image.

00:01:40.983 --> 00:01:43.111
Every source is in the full article.

00:01:43.111 --> 00:01:43.719
I'm Thimble.

00:01:43.719 --> 00:01:44.023
Bye!
